.ch/image/WL_749_Val_Meltger_2_s.jpg","foto_small":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-small/WL_749_Val_Meltger_2_k.jpg","foto_abstract":null,"logo":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/WL_749_GR_RGB_140x140.jpg","logo_svg":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-svg/WL_749_GR.svg","x_coordinate":763065.4674744569,"y_coordinate":173223.2316808944,"description":"Lantsch/Lenz sits atop a sunny terrace above the Albula Valley. The local attractions include three churches, among them the St. Anthony of Padua parish church in the centre of the village on your route. You descend through the alleyways to the street crossing by the La Tgorna restaurant. You gradually leave the residential area behind you, and the surfaced road soon becomes a natural path. Here, the steep climb through the sparse mountain forest up to the Val Meltger suspension bridge begins. It was built in 2005 after avalanches swept the old bridge away numerous times. This should no longer happen: The bridge spans the deep ravine at a height of 12 metres. From the bridge, you have impressive views into the wild ravine and of the surrounding slopes, to Savognin, the Julier Pass and the Engadin. \n\nAfter crossing the bridge, a narrow path takes you on towards Vasternos. The landscape opens up; the isolated mountain hut marks the transition to more sedate terrain. A forest road descends gently before climbing again at a fork. It crosses the largely dried up mountain stream at Runcalatsch, where it’s worth taking a brief look down into the rocky stream bed. The route then continues downwards and back to the starting point in the village.\n\nThe hike combines different landscapes: narrow forest paths, open Alpine meadows and a spectacular ravine crossing. The contrasts between the peaceful sections and the exposed passages on the bridge are characteristic. There are few historic buildings and little tourist infrastructure, which underscores the unspoiled nature of the route. While the differences in elevation require good physical fitness, you’re rewarded with varied views and a powerful experience of nature.","length":8,"length_asphalt":null,"length_unsurfaced":null,"length_singletrail":null,"height_difference":400,"height_difference_back":400,"height_downwards":null,"hiking_time":2.5,"hiking_time_back":2.5,"category_grade":"medium","category_grade_text":"mountain hiking trail","category_grade_skiing":null,"category_condition":"medium","category_condition_text":null,"cantons":[2],"photo_gallery":["https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/WL_749_Val_Melter_3_s.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/WL_749_Val_Meltger_2_s.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/WL_749_Val_Meltger_1_s.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/WL_749_Val_Meltger_4_s.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/WL_749_Val_Meltger_s.jpg"],"photo_gallery_big":["https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-big/WL_749_Val_Melter_3_g.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-big/WL_749_Val_Meltger_2_g.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-big/WL_749_Val_Meltger_1_g.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-big/WL_749_Val_Meltger_4_g.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-big/WL_749_Val_Meltger_g.jpg"],"photo_gallery_urls":[{"1800X1440":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/WL_749_Val_Melter_3_1800x1440.jpg","900X720":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/WL_749_Val_Melter_3_900x720.jpg","550X440":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/WL_749_Val_Melter_3_550x440.jpg","275X220":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/WL_749_Val_Melter_3_275x220.jpg"},{"550X440":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/WL_749_Val_Meltger_2_550x440.jpg","900X720":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/WL_749_Val_Meltger_2_900x720.jpg","275X220":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/WL_749_Val_Meltger_2_275x220.jpg","1800X1440":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/WL_749_Val_Meltger_2_1800x1440.jpg"},{"550X440":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/WL_749_Val_Meltger_1_550x440.jpg","900X720":"https://images.schweizm